!==============================================================================
! Grid: 2D R-Z, 18×1×4
!   X(R): 2.50 → 10.8652 m  (cement 2.50-2.55, rock+fracture 2.55-10.8652)
!   Y:    0.0  → 1.0 m      (degenerate — single 1m slab)
!   Z:   -1.0  → 0.005 m    (rock -1.0→0, fracture half-aperture 0→0.005)
!==============================================================================
GRID
  TYPE STRUCTURED
  NXYZ 29 1 4
  DXYZ
    0.025 0.015 0.01 0.05 0.05 0.075 0.075 0.1125 0.1125 0.16875 0.16875 0.253125 0.253125 0.379688 0.379688 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.4455 0.445537 0.445537
    1.0
    0.9 0.095 0.005 1.336980688e-05
  /
  ORIGIN 2.50d0 0.d0 -1.0d0
  GRAVITY 0.d0 0.d0 -9.81d0
END

